-- INVISIBLE CHARACTER ---------------------------------------- main.kl  SEC0111

I found the invisible character U+200B (ZERO WIDTH SPACE). It can make two different names look the same.

2│     let name = "Sa​ra"
                     ^

Try: `\u{200B}`

Help: In code or a name, delete it (`kalam fix` does this). Inside a string, write it as `\u{...}` so readers can see it.

Learn more: kalam explain SEC0111
